      "description": "Read the LIVE merch catalog from the Shopify store powering the app's Shop page \u2014 the only source of truth for merch. Returns each product's shopify_product_id, title, description, price, currency, availability, product URL and real product photo. Call this before planning or generating anything merch-related, and pass the returned shopify_product_id to generateMarketingImage."
