    {
      "function_name": "generateMarketingImage",
      "description": "Generate a REAL marketing image, save it to the existing Gallery with its visual direction, and attach it to a draft post. Pass post_id plus prompt, aspect_ratio (4:5, 1:1 or 9:16) and a structured visual_direction (visual_type, creative_concept, content_objective, subject, setting, composition, camera_angle, framing, lighting, mood, color_direction, materials, textures, movement, text_overlay, typography_direction, safe_area_requirements, reference_assets, elements_to_preserve, elements_to_avoid, reason_for_match). For merch, ALWAYS pass shopify_product_id (from listShopifyProducts) on every generation \u2014 that product's live Shopify photo is then automatically attached as the design reference and the printed artwork is locked so it stays identical across the series. Optional: campaign_id, release_id, track_id, product_id, text_overlay, reference_asset_urls, original_request, regenerate + variation_instruction. Returns ok, media_id, image_url, post_id, aspect_ratio and the previous version. Never approves, schedules or publishes."
